---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about the Vibe Design project and its approach to teaching UI design.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <h1 class="text-h1">About Vibe Design</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary about-lead">
      A free, open-source project that teaches UI design through hands-on, interactive lessons built with Figma and modern web technologies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-card">
        <h2 class="text-h3">Why We Built This</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-secondary">
          Learning UI design shouldn't mean watching hours of passive video content. We believe in learning by doing &mdash; building real components, seeing immediate results, and understanding the "why" behind every decision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-card">
        <h2 class="text-h3">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-secondary">
          Each lesson is a progressive walkthrough where you build something tangible. Start with the simplest version, then iterate step-by-step until you have a production-ready component or system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-card">
        <h2 class="text-h3">The Tech Stack</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-secondary">
          Built with Astro for zero-JS static generation, CSS custom properties for the theming system, and vanilla JavaScript for interactivity. No frameworks needed &mdash; just the web platform.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-card">
        <h2 class="text-h3">Design-First</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-secondary">
          Every page was designed in Figma before a single line of code was written. The component library, color system, and typography scale all started as Figma design tokens.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-cta">
      <h2 class="text-h2">Ready to start learning?</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/lessons`} class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Browse Lessons</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-10) var(--space-6);
    max-width: 1440px;
  }

  .about-lead {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-content {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .about-card h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .about-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-8);
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .btn--primary { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
  .btn--primary:hover { background: var(--color-primary-hover); color: #fff; }
  .btn--lg { font-size: var(--text-body); padding: 0.75rem 2rem; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero { padding-inline: var(--space-4); }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
